{"ID":"20240205153652-gn0nwhn","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205153652-gn0nwhn","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153652-gn0nwhn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205163749-1873u80\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240611145025-qxexd72\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:5701,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240705161018-1qrytk6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"172贝母","type":"doc","updated":"20240814171212"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240205163749-1873u80","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163749-1873u80","updated":"20240205164109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"川贝母"}]},{"ID":"20240206082445-ursaf6w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206082445-ursaf6w","updated":"20240206082451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产四川、云南、青海、西藏等地。\n【性状】\t松贝呈类圆锥形或近球形，高0.30.8cm，直径0.30.9cm。表面类白色。外层鳞叶2瓣，大小悬殊，大瓣紧抱小瓣，未抱部分呈新月形，顶部闭合。内有类圆柱形、顶端稍尖的心芽和小鳞叶12枚。先端钝圆或稍尖，底部平，微凹入，中心有一灰褐色的鳞茎盘，偶有残存须根。质硬脆，断面白色，富粉性。气微，味微苦。青贝呈类扁球形，高0.41.4cm，直径0.41.6cm。外层鳞叶2瓣，大小相近，相对抱合，顶部开裂。内有心芽和小鳞叶23枚及细圆柱形的残茎。\n炉贝呈长圆锥形，高0.72.5cm，直径0.52.5cm。表面类白色 (白炉贝) 或浅棕黄色 (黄炉贝)，有的具棕色斑点。外层鳞叶2瓣，大小相近，顶部开裂而略尖，基部稍尖或较钝。\n【性味】\t甘、苦，微寒。\n【功效】\t清热润肺，化痰止咳。用于肺热燥咳，干咳少痰，阴虚劳嗽，咯痰带血。\n【注解】\t“怀中抱月”：松贝的外层磷叶2瓣，大小悬殊，大瓣紧抱小瓣，未抱部分呈新月形。\n“缕衣黑笃”：松贝药材基部稍凹入，间见黑斑，留有根须痕。\n“观音坐莲”：松贝底部平、微凹入，平放能端正稳坐。"}]},{"ID":"20240206082437-7tvyqnv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206082437-7tvyqnv","updated":"20240206082437"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206082437-f43iw3d.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205163754-df7dawt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205163754-df7dawt","updated":"20240205163754"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"川贝母"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/川贝母-20240205163754-ya977yr.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]}]},{"ID":"20240624163006-g2yxhsd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240624163006-g2yxhsd","updated":"20240814155942"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 373px;","style":"width: 363px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝母 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贝母 2-20240814155939-twpizgq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 363px;\" parent-style=\"width: 373px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240814155817-76tihz3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240814155817-76tihz3","updated":"20240814164405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 373px;","style":"width: 363px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝母"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/贝母-20240814155817-vlsqss2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 363px;\" parent-style=\"width: 373px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 373px;","style":"width: 363px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"贝母 (24)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"